<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F4778F0" style="font-family: Ciutadella, Arial, Verdana, serif; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F477B50"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F477DB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478010" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478270"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F4784D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478730" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478990"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478E40" style="line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 45px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F4790A0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 10px; font-variant-ligatures: none; height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F479430" style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"><br></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F479690" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 10px; font-variant-ligatures: none; height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47A000" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47A700"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47A960" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47ABC0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2024584737/Module-Header-Brand-Extended-generic.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680" height="70" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47AE20"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47B640"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47B8A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47C0E0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47C340"><td valign="top" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47C5A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47CA50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47D3D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47D630" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47ECC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47EF20" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I am pleased to share that Qantas has brought forward the restart of international flights to popular destinations from Sydney and Melbourne. Qantas will also operate regular flights from Sydney to Delhi, the first commercial flights for Qantas between Australia and India in almost a decade.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The faster ramp up follows the Federal, New South Wales and Victorian governments confirming that international borders would reopen from November 2021 and the decision by the NSW and Victorian governments to remove quarantine requirements for fully vaccinated arrivals - which significantly increases travel demand.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif">International schedule updates</font></strong></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 12px; height: 12px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif">From Sydney</font></strong></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 12px; height: 12px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Sydney-London:</strong>&nbsp;flights will resume on 1 November 2021, operating up to five return flights per week with 787 aircraft.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Sydney-Los Angeles:</strong>&nbsp;flights will resume on 1 November 2021, operating up to four return flights per week with 787 aircraft.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Sydney-Singapore:</strong>&nbsp;will resume on 23 November 2021, four weeks earlier than scheduled, operating three days per week with A330 aircraft. Services will ramp up to daily from 18 December 2021.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Sydney-Fiji (Nadi):</strong>&nbsp;flights will be brought forward to 7 December 2021 from 19 December 2021. Four return flights a week will be operated by 737 aircraft.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Sydney-Johannesburg:</strong>&nbsp;flights will resume on 5 January 2022, three months earlier than scheduled. Three return flights a week will be operated by 787 aircraft.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Sydney-Bangkok:</strong>&nbsp;flights will resume on 14 January 2022, more than two months earlier than scheduled. Five return flights a week will be operated by A330 aircraft.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif">From Melbourne</font></strong></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 12px; height: 12px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Melbourne-London:</strong>&nbsp;flights
will resume on 27 November 2021, operating two days per week with 787 aircraft and ramping up to daily from 18 December 2021.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 24px; font-size: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;">•</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Melbourne-Singapore:</strong>&nbsp;flights will be brought forward to 22 November 2021, three weeks ahead of scheduled, operating three days per week with A330 aircraft and ramping up to daily from 18 December.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Flights from Melbourne to Los Angeles will restart from 18 December 2021 with other destinations scheduled to recommence in the new year.&nbsp;<strong>Qantas and Jetstar will look at bringing forward additional destinations if possible.</strong></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Our new route from Sydney to Delhi will launch on 6 December 2021 with three return flights per week with the A330, building to daily by the end of the year. This is subject to discussions with Indian authorities to finalise necessary approvals. Flights will initially operate until at least late March 2022, with a view to continuing if there is sufficient demand. Sydney-Delhi will operate via Darwin, while flights from Delhi to Sydney will operate nonstop.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We have also launched additional&nbsp;<i>Points Planes</i>&nbsp;- where every seat in every cabin on a flight is available to book as a reward seat.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Discussions are underway with the Indonesian Government about welcoming fully vaccinated Australians back to Bali with reduced or no quarantine requirements, which would mean the resumption of Qantas flights from Sydney to the holiday island months earlier than scheduled.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">In line with current Federal Government requirements, these initial flights are limited to Australian citizens, permanent residents and their&nbsp;<a href="https://covid19.homeaffairs.gov.au/immediate-family-australian-citizens-or-permanent-residents-or-new-zealand-citizens-usually-resident-australia" target="_blank" title="Immediate family of Australian citizens or permanent residents or New Zealand citizens usually resident in Australia" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">immediate families</a>&nbsp;and parents.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">All passengers on Qantas international flights (aged 12 years and older) will be required to be fully vaccinated with a&nbsp;<a href="https://www.tga.gov.au/covid-19-vaccines-not-registered-australia-current-international-use-tga-advice-recognition" target="_blank" title="TGA-approved or recognised vaccine" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">TGA-approved or recognised vaccine</a>&nbsp;(unless they have an exemption). For further information on what customers should expect on these initial flights please see&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates/coronavirus/qantas-international-network-changes.html?int_cam=au%3Acoronavirus%3Aarticle%3Ainternational-flights%3Aen%3Ann" target="_blank" title="Qantas.com" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Qantas.com</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me. We look forward to welcoming our customers back onboard our international flights from next month.<br><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="line-height: 20px;"><br></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F905AC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F905D20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your ongoing support.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9061E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F906440" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F906900"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F906B60" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907010" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907270"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">{!User.Title}</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9074B0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9075C0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Qantas Corporate Sales</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907A60"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Qantas Airways Limited</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907CA0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907DB0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907FF0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">P. 13 10 85</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F908230"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">E.&nbsp;</span></font></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" color="#666666">{!User.Email}</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F908B70"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F908DD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909290"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9094F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" height="50" width="307" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2019333048/1710footerQantasOneworldLogo.jpg" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909880"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909D20"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876090" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876550"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8767B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 9px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876A10" style="font-weight: bold;">Qantas Privacy Notice</span><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876C70"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876EB0" style="">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85. To unsubscribe from Qantas updates or marketing offers, contact your Account Manager <a href="mailto:?subject=Unsubscribe%20from%20Qantas%20updates%20marketing%20offers">here</a> to unsubscribe.</span></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8774A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E877700" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E878E60" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8790C0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E879320" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E879580" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8797E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E879A40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E87A150"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E87A3B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="1">Important information</font><br><span style="font-size: 7pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">International
flights remain subject to Government and Regulatory approval.<br><br></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
